*
!.gitignore
# The seeded community listings' photographs are part of the demo dataset, not
# user data. They are fetched from Wikimedia Commons by
# `tools/fetch_seed_photos.py` and committed so a fresh clone (or a deploy to
# another server) has a board with real pictures on it. CREDITS.md, next to
# them, names the author and licence of every one.
!seed-listings/
!seed-listings/*
